{"tool_name":"opencomet","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>This workflow will batch process a directory of images: - comets should be horizontally oriented, tails to the right. Additional preprocessing is required if the gel does not match with this orientation (Rotate images, Using ImageJ/Transform Image or TransformJ plugin for example). Then using the plugin:</p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>Uneven background correction</li>\n\t<li>Automatic detection of comet shapes with outliers detection</li>\n\t<li>Automatic detection of the&nbsp;heads of comets&nbsp;(brightest region or profile analysis)</li>\n\t<li>Statistical values of tails, heads and Olive moments.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Manual correction is available.</li>\n\t<li>Does live analysis with Micro-Manager</li>\n</ul>","summary":"","value":"<p>This workflow will batch process a directory of images: - comets should be horizontally oriented, tails to the right. Additional preprocessing is required if the gel does not match with this orientation (Rotate images, Using ImageJ/Transform Image or TransformJ plugin for example). Then using the plugin:</p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n\t<li>Uneven background correction</li>\r\n\t<li>Automatic detection of comet shapes with outliers detection</li>\r\n\t<li>Automatic detection of the&nbsp;heads of comets&nbsp;(brightest region or profile analysis)</li>\r\n\t<li>Statistical values of tails, heads and Olive moments.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Manual correction is available.</li>\r\n\t<li>Does live analysis with Micro-Manager</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2023-05-03T14:40:51+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2015-03-09T13:42:05+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[{"target_id":4483,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"e48d43dc-4066-4e4c-90a0-572cec87f957","url":"/taxonomy/term/4483"},